# Unified API Contracts Usage

RULE: Use unified-api-contracts for all external API schemas and VCR mocks. Never duplicate contract logic in services.
CODEX: 02-data/contracts-scope-and-layout.md, 05-infrastructure/contracts-integration.md

**When to use:** (1) External API response parsing — Pydantic schemas for Databento, Tardis, CCXT, The Graph, exchanges. (2) Normalization — after model_validate(), map to canonical via UAC normalizers; interfaces return canonical only. (3) Tests — VCR cassettes from unified-api-contracts/<venue>/mocks/. (4) New venues — add schemas in UAC before adapter.

**Typed response models (mandatory):** Create _<provider>_models.py with Pydantic BaseModel; use model_validate() at boundary; never dict[str, Any]. PascalCase: Field(alias="...") + populate_by_name. Exemplar: unified-sports-execution-interface adapters.

**Context7:** Append "use context7" when working with external APIs. Path deps: see path-dependency-ci.mdc. Full spec: contracts-integration.mdc, no-type-any-use-specific.mdc.
